sequenceDiagram
 participant C as MCP Host/Client
 participant P as MCP Resource Server
 participant M as PRM Metadata
 participant A as Authorization Server
 participant V as Token Verifier
 participant G as Tool/Domain Gateway
 C->>P: tools/call (no bearer)
 P-->>C: 401 + WWW-Authenticate resource_metadata
 C->>M: GET RFC 9728 PRM
 M-->>C: resource + authorization_servers + scopes
 C->>A: OAuth code + PKCE + resource indicator
 A-->>C: resource-bound access token
 C->>P: stateless MCP request + Bearer token
 P->>V: Verify signature + iss + aud + exp + nbf
 V-->>P: Verified claims + scopes
 P->>P: Required method/tool scope?
 alt Missing scope
  P-->>C: 403 insufficient_scope + step-up
 else Scope valid
  P->>G: subject + tenant + requested object
  G->>G: Object/tenant authorization + policy
  G-->>P: Result or denial
  P-->>C: MCP result + redacted audit
 end
